The datasets in this directory (releases.csv, daily.csv) are dedicated to the
public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal.

https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

They are derived from the public npm registry and from Google's deps.dev API.
Both permit this use; deps.dev expressly permits clients to cache its data.
No attribution is required, though a link back is appreciated.
